     Actually[0m[2m, I[0m[2m need[0m[2m to be[0m[2m careful about[0m[2m Payment[0m[2mGateway id[0m[2mempotency[0m[2m. If[0m[2m `[0m[2mcharge`[0m[2m was[0m[2m previously[0m[2m called and[0m[2m failed,[0m[2m should a[0m[2m subsequent call[0m[2m with[0m[2m the same[0m[2m `order[0m[2m_id`[0m[2m retry[0m[2m?[0m[2m The problem[0m[2m says "[0m[2mNo order[0m[2m is charged[0m[2m more than[0m[2m once".[0m[2m So[0m[2m if it[0m[2m already[0m[2m succeeded,[0m[2m return[0m[2m True.[0m[2m If it[0m[2m already[0m[2m failed...[0m[2m that's[0m[2m trick[0m[2mier.[0m[2m But typically[0m[2m id[0m[2mempotency[0m[2m means:[0m[2m the[0m[2m same operation[0m[2m with[0m[2m the same[0m[2m idempotent[0m[2m key[0m[2m should have[0m[2m the same[0m[2m effect.[0m[2m So[0m[2m if it[0m[2m was[0m[2m already[0m[2m charged successfully[0m[2m, don't[0m[2m charge again[0m[2m. If[0m[2m it was[0m[2m never charged[0m[2m, charge[0m[2m it.[0m[2m
     
