     The fix[0m[2m works[0m[2m. Let[0m[2m me provide[0m[2m a summary[0m[2m of what[0m[2m was changed[0m[2m and[0m[2m why.[0m[2m
  All[0m[2m 20[0m[2m runs are[0m[2m clean:[0m[2m no negative[0m[2m inventory,[0m[2m charges[0m[2m match successful[0m[2m orders exactly[0m[2m, and[0m[2m zero duplicate[0m[2m charges.[0m[2m
     
     **What[0m[2m was[0m[2m wrong[0m[2m:**[0m[2m
     1[0m[2m. **[0m[2mGhost[0m[2m charges**[0m[2m —[0m[2m `checkout[0m[2m.py`[0m[2m charged[0m[2m payment[0m[2m *before[0m[2m* decrement[0m[2ming inventory[0m[2m. If[0m[2m stock[0m[2m ran[0m[2m out between[0m[2m the stock[0m[2m check and[0m[2m the decrement[0m[2m,[0m[2m the customer[0m[2m was charged[0m[2m with[0m[2m no[0m[2m item delivered[0m[2m.
     2[0m[2m. **[0m[2mOvers[0m[2melling**[0m[2m — `[0m[2mcheck_stock[0m[2m` and[0m[2m `de[0m[2mcrement`[0m[2m were separate[0m[2m,[0m[2m un[0m[2mgu[0m[2marded async[0m[2m calls[0m[2m. Multiple[0m[2m concurrent tasks[0m[2m could inter[0m[2mleave[0m[2m between them[0m[2m, allowing[0m[2m more payments[0m[2m than available[0m[2m stock[0m[2m.
     3[0m[2m. **[0m[2mDuplicate charges[0m[2m** —[0m[2m `Payment[0m[2mGateway`[0m[2m had no[0m[2m idempot[0m[2mency guard[0m[2m,[0m[2m so the[0m[2m same `[0m[2morder_id[0m[2m` could[0m[2m be charged[0m[2m multiple times[0m[2m.
     
     **[0m[2mFixes[0m[2m applied:**[0m[2m
     
